@startuml activity_respond_rate
!include skin.iuml
skinparam ConditionEndStyle hline

|#FFFFFF|Host|
|#F4F4F1|API server|
|#FAFAF8|Participant|

|Host|
start
:Open the pending requests
for the activity;
:GET /api/activities/{id}/requests;

|API server|
:Refuse anyone who is not the host, then return
each requester's name, gender and average rating;

|Host|
:Accept or decline;
:POST .../requests/{requestId}/accept or .../decline;

|API server|
:BEGIN TRANSACTION;
:SELECT the activity and the request FOR UPDATE, so
two taps arriving together cannot both pass the
capacity check;
if (Caller is the host and the
request is still pending?) then (no)
  |API server|
  :403 or 400, then roll back;
  detach
else (yes)
endif
if (Accepted?) then (yes)
  |API server|
  if (Still room under max_people?) then (no)
    |API server|
    :409 - it filled up while
    the request was waiting;
    detach
  else (yes)
  endif
  :Add the student to activity_participants and to
  conversation_participants, which is what puts
  them in the group chat;
else (no)
endif
:Update the request status and responded_at;
:COMMIT, then notify the requester either way;

|Participant|
:Open the group chat from Messages and connect
the Socket.IO client with the JWT in the handshake;
|API server|
:Verify the token, then check conversation_participants
before letting the socket join the room;
|Participant|
:Send a message;
|API server|
:Persist it, then broadcast message:new to the room;
|Host|
:Receive it without polling;

|Participant|
:Meet, take part in the activity,
then open it again to leave a rating;
|API server|
if (Now is past starts_at + duration_minutes?) then (no)
  |API server|
  :400 - rating stays closed
  until the activity is over;
  detach
else (yes)
endif
if (Rater and rated both took part,
and are not the same person?) then (no)
  |API server|
  :400 or 403;
  detach
else (yes)
endif
:Upsert the score, one rating per
(activity, rater, rated) triple;
:Notify the rated student and fold the score into
the average shown on their future listings;
|Participant|
stop

@enduml
